{
  "id": "05-cross-file",
  "title": "跨文件价格边界",
  "category": "cross-file",
  "prompt": "修复免运费边界：商品小计达到 100（含 100）即免运费。结算金额与提示必须一致，沿用已有 shippingCost，不增加其他价格策略。",
  "contextFiles": [
    "src/pricing.mjs",
    "src/checkout.mjs",
    "checks/oracle.mjs"
  ],
  "changeAllowlist": [
    "src/pricing.mjs",
    "src/checkout.mjs"
  ],
  "expectedArtifacts": [
    "src/pricing.mjs",
    "src/checkout.mjs"
  ],
  "passChecks": [
    {
      "id": "checkout-boundary",
      "kind": "automated",
      "command": "node --test checks/oracle.mjs",
      "criteria": [
        "99、100、101 的运费、总价、免运费标记相互一致。",
        "结算保持原有返回结构。"
      ],
      "status": "ready",
      "pendingReason": null
    },
    {
      "id": "responsible-layer",
      "kind": "manual",
      "command": null,
      "criteria": [
        "免运费规则由已有 shippingCost 负责；结算金额与提示复用该规则，不在调用方重复阈值、硬编码边界结果或改写 oracle 来通过检查。",
        "允许必要的跨文件修改；根据职责归属与整体复杂度评估方案，不按修改行数或文件数评分。"
      ],
      "status": "pending",
      "pendingReason": "需要审阅实际 Agent diff 与负责层；固定输入的行为断言不能独自证明规则复用。"
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "required": false,
    "askOnlyFor": []
  },
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "modelInput": {
    "promptField": "prompt",
    "contextFilesField": "contextFiles",
    "inspectBeforeChanges": true,
    "doNotTreatTaskMetadataAsAnAdditionalGlobalRule": true
  }
}
